# Scripted input for compose_window_drag_and_drop.kt's window (KLIO_WIN_INPUT):
# another application drops text, then two files, on the target (the lower
# box); then a drag from the source (the upper box) down to the target. The
# pointer hovers over the source before it presses, as a mouse does: a
# gesture starts listening on the first event that reaches it.
6 drop 100 90 text hello from elsewhere
10 drop 100 90 files /tmp/notes.txt|/tmp/photo.png
13 move 100 30
14 press 100 30
16 move 105 40
18 move 110 60
20 move 110 90
22 release 110 90
28 close
